---
import { networkSites } from '../../data/network'
---

<section id="network" class="border-b-2 border-[var(--ink)] bg-[var(--paper)]">
  <div class="container-app">
    <div class="border-x-2 border-[var(--ink)]">
      <div class="cell border-b-2 border-[var(--ink)] reveal">
        <h2 class="text-macro">JPanda Network</h2>
        <p class="font-ko text-sm text-[var(--muted)] mt-3">제이판다 네트워크</p>
        <p class="text-sm max-w-2xl mt-6 leading-relaxed bilingual">
          Research, civic intelligence, strategic analysis, and AI infrastructure. Each property serves a distinct mission within one unified vision.
          <span class="ko block">연구, 시민 인텔리전스, 전략 분석, AI 인프라. 통합된 비전 안의 고유한 사명.</span>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="blueprint-grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 reveal">
        {networkSites.map(site => (
          <a
            href={site.url}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="network-link cell"
          >
            <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-4">
              <code class="font-mono-ui text-[var(--ink)] text-[0.65rem]">{site.name}</code>
              {site.tag && <span class="tag-hazard">{site.tag}</span>}
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-[var(--muted)] leading-relaxed">{site.description}</p>
            <span class="link-arrow font-mono-ui text-[var(--muted)] mt-4 inline-block transition-colors">Visit &gt;&gt;&gt;</span>
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>